<a name="menus"></a>
<a name="optmenu"></a>
<h2> Options menu </h2>

<p> <img src="../images/iLarn/8options.gif" alt="[options menu]"> </p>

<dl>
<dt> <b>Map</b> /M

In the middle part of the screen, you can only see a part of the level
