to the <a href="download.php">download page</a>.

<br> <img src="../images/iLarn/7map2.gif" alt="[small font]">

<dt> <b>Instructions</b>

<dd> Same as what you would see if you played Ularn.

<dt> <b>About iLarn</b>

<dd> This is the "About" screen that you find in all normal applications.

<dt> (Q) <b>Quit</b>

<dd> This will kill your current character (after the obligatory "are
you SURE?") and allow you to start over.  This dialog can also be
accessed by writing a graffiti "<b>Q</b>".

</dl>

