</div>

<div class="content">
<a name="cmdmenu"></a>
<h2> Commands menu </h2>

<p> <img src="../images/iLarn/8commands.gif" alt="[commands menu]"> </p>

<p> The following menu items can accessed faster by writing the graffiti
