<br> <img src="../images/iLarn/Acast.gif" alt="[cast spell]">
 <img src="../images/iLarn/Acast2.gif" alt="[cast spell]">
 <img src="../images/iLarn/Acast3.gif" alt="[cast spell]">
 <img src="../images/iLarn/Acast4.gif" alt="[cast spell]"> 

<br> The effect duration column (which you will see on the right)
