<a name="inventory"></a>
<h2> Inventory </h2>

<p> Adventurers tend to collect things.  Where do they go?  Your pack.
How do you do something with them once they are there? </p>

<p> To do something to an item in your inventory, select "Inventory"
from the Commands menu (or write "<b>i</b>", lower-case I.)
A window will pop up with a list of your inventory.  Select any item.
This should cause some buttons to appear, labeled with relevant
actions.  Tap the button of your choice to perform that action. </p>

<p> Rings, amulets, and similar beneficial trinkets will bestow their
effects just by being carried in your inventory. </p>

<p> You can wield almost any kind of thing, even if it doesn't make a
very good weapon.  This is what we like to call a "feature". </p>

<p> <img src="../images/iLarn/8inv.gif" alt="[inventory]">
